personality = "Tiko is Kaia's apprentice - a lanky teenager with soot-stained fingers and a hunger to create. He worships Kaia but dreams of building things she'd call frivolous - music boxes, automata, clockwork birds. He's clumsy with a hammer but brilliant with delicate mechanisms. He keeps a sketchbook of impossible machines. He's terrified of disappointing her."
